    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37274" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pŏtămŏgēton</span></b>  or
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pŏtămŏgīton</span></b> ,
			ŏnis, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποταμογείτων</span> (a neighbor of the river),
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
